			"notes": "Fixed all caves being flooded below Y=55. I was so focused on the terrain above-ground that I never noticed this bug. Sorry to anyone who generated survival worlds with v4.0 and v4.1 :(\n\nThis version also makes sculk generate at lower y-levels in general to avoid it causing river tunnels to be dried out in many cases. It does so by altering the \"depth\" worldgen parameter range, hopefully this does not cause any unforseen issues."
